  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743ae6a5a49c635d8ac648/step-052f9e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice celery.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743ae6a5a49c635d8ac648/step-41314510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add onion chutney and a splash of water. Gently toss haloumi to coat.\n• While the haloumi is cooking, in a second medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, celery, carrot and tomato. Add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat, then season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743ae6a5a49c635d8ac648/step-7dc4fd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tomato salad between bowls. Top with seared haloumi, spooning over any remaining glaze from the pan.\n• Drizzle with garlic sauce and garnish with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743ae6a5a49c635d8ac648/step-de974f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
